tps://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5791,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T22:40:26Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-08-21T11:47:41Z","updated_at":"2026-08-21T17:56:24Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122692","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122692","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122692.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122692.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"We've been revising the implementation with Claude AI, and it's possible it found and Fixed the root cause of:\r\n\r\n> Metal Shader Baking limited to SPIR-V: Unable to determine toolchain properties on iOS export.\r\n\r\n-Two bugs on the same line in drivers/metal/rendering_shader_container_metal.cpp:81\r\n\r\n```\r\n// BROKEN — escaped quotes become literal characters in the shell pattern, \r\n// AND the unquoted | is interpreted as a second pipe by sh -c \r\nparts.append_array({ \"-\", \"|\", \"grep\", \"-E\", R\"(\\\"__METAL_VERSION__|__ENVIRONMENT_OS\\\")\" });\r\n\r\n// FIXED\r\nparts.append_array({ \"-\", \"|\", \"grep\", \"-E\", \"'__METAL_VERSION__|__ENVIRONMENT_OS'\" });\r\n```\r\n\r\nAlso requires to install the MetalToolchain (not installed by default):\r\nxcodebuild -downloadComponent MetalToolchain`\r\n\r\n-With both fixes applied, the Export Warning disappears, \r\nShader Baker step completes and .metallib compilation runs at export time.\r\n\r\nIOW No more SPIR-V warning message;\r\nand the shader compilation step can be seen in Godot export.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122692/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122692/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}